{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 181, "text": "给龙亦飞的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n亦飞C 1 ] 女士：\n去年十月来信收到。王基永同志殉难，极为痛惜。兹幸遗\n孤成立，业己就学，为之喜慰。抚恤及帮助令郎等工作或学习\n事须与全国同类情形者同样办理，未便某处独异，请向当地党\n政陈明情形听候处理。此复，顺祝\n健康！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0 年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 亦飞，即龙亦飞，革命烈士王基永的夫人。王基永，\n一九\n二三年夏加入中国共产党。一九三0年六月在甘肃礼县牺牲。\n1 5 2  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "d71952394124e1c55d7e614b55bdf49612306c6fe951ef53a0cd0b157314cb9f", "text_chars": 232}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 182, "text": "＼ \n给王云晓的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n云晓( l )1 学兄：\n去年十一月来信收到，有志上进极好。工作问题希望就近\n设法解\n。此复，顺颂\n陕\n进步\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释1\nC 1 ] 云晓，即王云晓，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n1 5 3 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "1f10b4f8d2c8800a6091fb4eedf114f32ac99a03e69fd347468bb52e1d8b4098", "text_chars": 141}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 183, "text": "给毛春轩的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n春轩( 1 ] 叔祖大鉴：\n去年十二月来信业已收到，甚为感谢。浪秋、迪秋( 2 J i者\n位均宜在家工作，不要来北京，\n以免浪费时间。此复，顺祝\n春安\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 春轩，即毛春轩，毛泽东的远房叔祖父。\nC 2 J 浪秋，即毛浪秋，迪秋，即毛迪秋，两人分别是毛春轩的\n儿子、侄子。\n154 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9f99cf5ae23266e159d00c3e1f7861d5782d07625a9cd6e8dbc0dc151ca7a0c3", "text_chars": 188}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 184, "text": "给郭健人的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n建人( 1 ] 兄：\n去年十一月来信收到。现在人民政府工作甚好，望于工作\n中加强学习，对千过去有所批判，\n以期日进有功。此复，顺颂\n健吉\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 建人，即郭健人，\n一九二五年参加韶山农民运动，并加入\n1 55 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "1429445902c0a3c1e098a8ddc2a4b61d34eeb20586745e3900c5b6950bf3ea79", "text_chars": 156}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 185, "text": "给刘庆勋的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n庆勋( 1 ] 学兄：\n去年十月六日\n［信J 及附件早已收到。吾兄从事工业技术\n是有益的，希望继续努力，\n为人民利益而服务。此复，顺祝\n进步\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 庆勋，\n即刘庆勋，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n1 5 6  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "8f09f760e5e3558244e292226e78c422fed01c63d8cd9168317cf1c5ec341792", "text_chars": 155}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 186, "text": "致强( 1 J 先生：\n给刘致强的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n去年十一月来信及自传收到。关于过去历史，希望先生有\n所批判。工作以在现地为宜，不要来京。此复，顺祝\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\n1\nC 1 ) 致强，即刘致强，\n当时家住贵阳市。\n1 5 7  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "479d0bd58342a6c18422ff8b04c05b161322ac1494a4978479bef06284ccefa3", "text_chars": 147}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 187, "text": "给黄滨的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n黄滨( 1 ] 同志：\n你的信收到了，谢谢你。你在宁乡工作甚好，希望你努力\n将工作做好。祝你健康，进步。江青向你致问候之意。\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 黄滨，原毛泽东身边工作人员。\n当时在湖南宁乡县电讯室\n工作。\n1 58 \n／\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "545275abb8b868afe1c6bda29897936ffe3c1d06da21942bba64ec0a4f9fd8ff", "text_chars": 150}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 188, "text": "给张四维的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n四维C 1 ] 兄：\n一月十六日来信收到。吾兄已在盐业公司获得职业，甚\n好，应就此项工作努力，取得成绩与信任，不要来北京。北京\n人浮千事，不好安置。前已复一信C 2 J , 未知收到否？顺祝\n进步！\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 四维，即张四维，湖南湘潭县韶山村人，大革命时期曾参\n加韶山农民运动。\n当时在中国盐业公司湖南省公司工作。\nC 2 ] 前巳复一信，指毛泽东一九四九年十一月十七日给张四维\n的信。信中说：“未阳电悉，甚感好意。湖南需才孔急，似以在当地\n工作为宜。”\n159 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "f0e5dcaa76a36bd6960b711fbe0402446a213adf3347e13dceb15454f98c2a67", "text_chars": 277}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 189, "text": "给张一权的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n一权C l ] 学兄：\n惠书敬悉，感谢你的好意。北京人浮千事，兄来不一定有\n好处，学习和工作，可就当地谋之，未审以为然否？率复，顺\n祝康吉！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ]\n一权，即张一权，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n当时家住长\n沙市。\n1 60 \n/\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "b8524522e17d35a5cc3454e2b4b5bbdd5bcbbcb2ae9041888f8faced23953344", "text_chars": 164}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 190, "text": "给王一凡的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n一凡[ l ] 学兄：\n元旦来信收到，感谢你的好意。工作事以就近设法解决为\n好。此复，顺祝\n健康！\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ]\n一凡，即王一凡，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n当时家住湖\n南宁乡县。\n161 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "37f1a43b135e9f623157f8baa66eb76dd329ec002fe0f62ced654b1d44a542d5", "text_chars": 142}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 191, "text": "忠获( 1 J 先生：\n给刘忠获的信\n（一九五0 年五月八日）\n贵友娄先生( 2 ] 有志研究极好。惟来京一事由弟推荐颇有\n未便，希望他另想办法。此复，顺颂\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月八日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 忠获，即刘忠获，大革命时期参加过北伐军。后到过延\n安。中华人民共和国成立后，任乡村小学教师、校长。\nC 2 J 娄先生，指娄伯平，\n当时在湖南浏阳县一所中学任教。\n1 62 \n/.\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "a7c3ca9360fe213347891fb54586685ed877c71dc3a6272ba337423d3d614e3d", "text_chars": 202}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 192, "text": "为询问舟山群岛作战的时间\n和谁备情况给粟裕的电报\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n粟裕C l ] 同志：\n你们计划何时举行舟山群岛作战[ 2 ] ，\n准备工作如何，\n盼告。\n毛\n泽\n东\n五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 粟裕，\n当时任中国人民解放军华东军区副司令员。\nC 2 J 舟山群岛作战，指解放舟山群岛本岛的作战。国民党军为\n了加强舟山防御，先后从台湾、金门等地抽调第五十二军、第十九\n军等增援舟山，使舟山守敌增至五个军十六个师，连同海空军及特\n种部队在内，共十二万人。根据这一情况，\n中国人民解放军华东军\n区决定增调第二十一军主力、第二十三军、第二十四军及炮兵一部，\n在第七兵团统一指挥下参加渡海作战，从而使参战兵力由四个师增\n加到十二个师又十个炮兵团，总兵力巳占很大优势。\n同时，新组建\n的海空军各一部巳进驻上海、宁波等地。一九五0年五月，正当各\n163 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "bb9cb75e27bdc895fb0ab75a393e8c7056d32dbac362a366a734510b00ea84d5", "text_chars": 387}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 193, "text": "部进攻舟山的准备工作大体就绪，即将发起战斗时，舟山群岛国民\n党守军从五月十三日开始撤退。五月十八日，人民解放军全部占领\n舟山群岛。\n1 64 \n-\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9c34b69093984fa930d17634a2b62f1506ada98fbae56aedc35554c537a30868", "text_chars": 74}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 194, "text": "给易克杻的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n克樵( 1 ] 学兄：\n两次惠书均收到，甚感盛意。工作岗位已觅定否？总以就\n近解决为宜。教育法令尚多阙如，\n只能边做边像，故无从寄\n奉。此复，顺祝健康\n并问王承淑先生安好\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 克樵，即易克樵，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学，新民学会会员。\n1 65 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "87acde17812e05e4d82be686c5eab184d62538d000b63cf90b23592f14032752", "text_chars": 184}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 195, "text": "给刘禄清的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n涤清C 1 ] 先生：\n来信收到，承以各地情况见告，极为感谢。如有所见，\n尚\n望随时告我为盼！此复，顺祝\n清吉\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 涤清，即刘涤清，\n当时家住湖南汉寿县毓德铺乡。\n1 6 6  \n/. \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "68c0948724da936d9e301f7da88cb979baf66e5845898b8bd010c5ea50283b0e", "text_chars": 146}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 196, "text": "给王葡初的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n硕初( l ] 学兄左右：\n惠书敬悉，甚感好意。所指工作中的缺点，\n正在注意纠\n正，吾兄倘有所见，\n尚祈随时示知。生活困难，极表同情，希\n望能就近获得解决。此复，顺祝\n健康\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 祈初，即王疡初，毛泽东青少年时期的同学。\n当时家住湖\n南湘乡县向龙乡。\n1 67 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "3cca3013266ba758348adc9d487bda421ec02e50127af2cfe7c3187cb9981166", "text_chars": 183}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 197, "text": "给方觉民的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n觉民( 1 ] 学兄：\n去年十二月来信收到，极为感谢。所指工作中的偏向，现\n正注意纠正，吾兄倘有所见，\n尚望随时示知。吾兄从事教育工\n作极为有益，\n尚祈按照新方向加以改进，福利人民。\n此复，顺颂\n教祺。不具。\n注\n释\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\nC 1 J 觉民，即方觉民，早年曾在毛泽东、何叔衡等主办的湖南\n自修大学附设补习学校学习。\n当时任湖南新化县大复初级中学副\n校长。\n168 \n-/＇ \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "82278b294630a5639c89ac59b07603db874a5b01201c51dbd502456023353b4c", "text_chars": 229}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 198, "text": "给薛批纶的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n世纶( 1 ] 学兄：\n四月十九日来信收到，感谢你的好意。吾兄从事教育工作\n极为有益，\n尚望加强进修，继续努力。风便尚祈时惠好音。敬\n颂教祺。不一\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 世纶，即薛世纶，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学。当时在湖南益阳从事教育工作。\n1 69 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "b37b4c1fd889001abad8eba6011519a426e6a6a0323d47f503d4e90096e08b14", "text_chars": 179}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 199, "text": "给罗元燮的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n元燮C 1 ] 学兄；\n两函均收到。生活困难，极表同情，望在长沙等处设法获\n得适当解决。情况如何，\n尚盼示知。顺颂\n大安\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0 年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 元燮，即罗元燮，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学。\n一九二一年在湖南省立第一中学工作时，掩护过毛泽东。\n中华人民共和国成立后，\n曾任湖南省文物管理委员会委员、省军政\n委员会参议、省参事室参事。\n1 70 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9c47fb68a8bdce5288767d6ad9305899620281723c2fe308f2a3ee2026dd8e51", "text_chars": 224}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 200, "text": "给曹直叽的信\n（一九五0 年五月十日）\n直明C 1 ] 先生：\n去年十二月来信并附件( 2 J 收到，感谢你的好意。附件已\n付卫生部研究。此复，即颂\n健进\n毛\n泽\n东\n一九五0年五月十日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 直明，即曹直明，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的同学。毕业后一直从事教育工作，并从父行医。抗日战争胜利后，\n专门从事医学研究工作。\n当时家住湖南华容县。\nC 2 ] 附件，指曹直明编著的《伤寒六经辨证类钞》。\n1 7 1  \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "05c7e12a523bd5fd008777fc7709393331eaed3d7093c8d98f5ceb4a2eafc5e2", "text_chars": 228}
